      "title": "Voting in the 2026 Municipal Election? Check the voters’ list",
      "summary": "Mississauga’s 2026 Municipal Election is on Monday, October 26. Eligible voters will elect Mississauga’s Mayor, their Ward/Regional Councillor and School Board Trustees for the 2026–2030 term of office. Use the Voter Registration Portal to check, update or add your information to the voters’ list before voting begins. Being on the voters’ list helps confirm you’re eligible to vote, helps ensure you receive a Voter notification card and can make the process faster when you arrive to vote.",
